1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:01,525
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,525 --> 00:00:03,675
Let's play a letter game!

3
00:00:04,225 --> 00:00:06,206
One letter is hiding.

4
00:00:06,206 --> 00:00:07,775
Can you find it?

5
00:00:09,475 --> 00:00:11,450
A, B, what?

6
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:14,150
Which letter is missing?

7
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:19,449
It's C!

8
00:00:19,999 --> 00:00:22,199
A, B, C!

9
00:00:22,749 --> 00:00:24,624
Well done!

10
00:00:26,324 --> 00:00:28,349
D, E, what?

11
00:00:28,749 --> 00:00:31,049
Which letter is missing?

12
00:00:34,699 --> 00:00:36,323
It's F!

13
00:00:36,873 --> 00:00:39,023
D, E, F!

14
00:00:39,573 --> 00:00:41,448
Well done!

15
00:00:43,148 --> 00:00:45,148
what, H, I?

16
00:00:45,548 --> 00:00:47,848
Which letter is missing?

17
00:00:51,498 --> 00:00:53,199
It's G!

18
00:00:53,749 --> 00:00:55,974
G, H, I!

19
00:00:58,974 --> 00:01:00,949
J, what, L?

20
00:01:01,349 --> 00:01:03,649
Which letter is missing?

21
00:01:07,299 --> 00:01:08,973
It's K!

22
00:01:09,523 --> 00:01:11,773
J, K, L!

23
00:01:12,323 --> 00:01:14,198
Well done!

24
00:01:15,898 --> 00:01:17,923
M, N, what?

25
00:01:18,323 --> 00:01:20,623
Which letter is missing?

26
00:01:24,273 --> 00:01:25,922
It's O!

27
00:01:26,472 --> 00:01:28,697
M, N, O!

28
00:01:29,247 --> 00:01:31,122
Well done!

29
00:01:32,822 --> 00:01:34,847
what, Q, R?

30
00:01:35,247 --> 00:01:37,547
Which letter is missing?

31
00:01:41,197 --> 00:01:42,947
It's P!

32
00:01:43,497 --> 00:01:45,722
P, Q, R!

33
00:01:48,722 --> 00:01:50,747
S, T, what?

34
00:01:51,147 --> 00:01:53,447
Which letter is missing?

35
00:01:57,097 --> 00:01:58,771
It's U!

36
00:01:59,321 --> 00:02:01,521
S, T, U!

37
00:02:02,071 --> 00:02:03,946
Well done!

38
00:02:05,646 --> 00:02:07,646
V, what, X?

39
00:02:08,046 --> 00:02:10,346
Which letter is missing?

40
00:02:13,996 --> 00:02:15,970
It's W!

41
00:02:16,520 --> 00:02:18,920
V, W, X!

42
00:02:19,470 --> 00:02:21,345
Well done!

43
00:02:23,045 --> 00:02:24,995
X, Y, what?

44
00:02:25,395 --> 00:02:27,695
Which letter is missing?

45
00:02:31,345 --> 00:02:33,046
It's Z!

46
00:02:33,596 --> 00:02:35,846
X, Y, Z!

47
00:02:38,846 --> 00:02:41,694
Now let's play a memory game!

48
00:02:42,244 --> 00:02:43,833
Do you remember?

49
00:02:43,833 --> 00:02:44,919
Let's see!

50
00:02:46,619 --> 00:02:48,744
What letter is this?

51
00:02:50,944 --> 00:02:52,370
C!

52
00:02:52,920 --> 00:02:55,220
Yes! Well done!

53
00:02:56,920 --> 00:02:59,045
What letter is this?

54
00:03:01,245 --> 00:03:02,569
F!

55
00:03:03,119 --> 00:03:05,069
That's right!

56
00:03:06,769 --> 00:03:08,894
What letter is this?

57
00:03:11,094 --> 00:03:12,493
G!

58
00:03:13,043 --> 00:03:15,068
Great job!

59
00:03:16,768 --> 00:03:18,893
What letter is this?

60
00:03:21,093 --> 00:03:22,492
K!

61
00:03:23,042 --> 00:03:25,017
You got it!

62
00:03:26,717 --> 00:03:28,842
What letter is this?

63
00:03:31,042 --> 00:03:32,416
O!

64
00:03:32,966 --> 00:03:34,666
Super!

65
00:03:36,366 --> 00:03:38,491
What letter is this?

66
00:03:40,691 --> 00:03:42,141
P!

67
00:03:42,691 --> 00:03:44,341
Hooray!

68
00:03:46,041 --> 00:03:48,166
What letter is this?

69
00:03:50,366 --> 00:03:51,890
U!

70
00:03:52,440 --> 00:03:54,740
Yes! Well done!

71
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:58,565
What letter is this?

72
00:04:00,765 --> 00:04:02,439
W!

73
00:04:02,989 --> 00:04:04,939
That's right!

74
00:04:06,639 --> 00:04:08,764
What letter is this?

75
00:04:10,964 --> 00:04:12,463
Z!

76
00:04:13,013 --> 00:04:15,038
Great job!

77
00:04:16,738 --> 00:04:19,763
Wow! You remembered everything!

78
00:04:21,613 --> 00:04:24,263
You are a super learner!

79
00:04:25,963 --> 00:04:28,937
You found every missing letter!

80
00:04:29,487 --> 00:04:32,287
Great job, little learner!

81
00:04:32,837 --> 00:04:34,788
Share Mimzi with a friend,

82
00:04:34,788 --> 00:04:37,412
and subscribe for more learning fun!

83
00:04:37,962 --> 00:04:38,983
Next time,

84
00:04:38,983 --> 00:04:41,811
let's read my picture dictionary.

85
00:04:42,061 --> 00:04:43,787
Bye bye!
